From a8e28a5cf608911fe62658d5b394a27d02a9cd70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jcs130 <lzl1992@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:29:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 33/35] fix: ground priority completion decisions in fresh
 state and failure history

Completion callbacks could precede passive state and exceed the host token cap, leaving Neko to plan from stale counts and only one outcome. Reserve fresh resource context, retain bounded matched-task history, and include prerequisite-aware recovery guidance. Ignore foreign and retroactive results and clear history for new game sessions.
---
